  "captureProvenance": "Current Molen World Viewer with PMTiles and standard Terrarium. The Torhalle has three continuous open passages, patterned red sandstone panels, slim pilasters, slate roofs, two side stair turrets and an open bell turret. The surviving three bays of the church include the buttressed west gable, Gothic window and shallow aisle arches."
